                        <h2>About Competent Certification Services</h2><br />
                        <strong>Competent Certification Services</strong>is an organization that specializes in all types of certification services established according to ISO / IEC 17021: 2011 requirement. Competent certification services is fastest growing organization in India in the field of certification services and we provide a scope of certification plans that are focused on providing a way for the producers, manufacturer and providers to meet the market's needs, whether they rely on upon control or customer driven. Competent is the vision of quality change through their wonderful services we deals in all types of certification services.<br />
                            Our team of vastly experienced business consultants take a practical down to earth approach ensuring certification is achieved simply and efficiently.<br />
                            Our clients are varied and are involved in all types of business activities including Healthcare, Manufacturing, Engineering, Construction, I.T., Distribution and other Services. We have issued certificates and helped organisations throughout the world to achieve their goals.<br />
                            Our mission is to provide businesses with a professional, affordable service to a realistic timescale in order for them to meet their objectives without the need for extensive internal resource commitment.<br />
                            We achieve this by utilising our highly trained, experienced staff and by cutting through the jargon to deliver a practical system. We at Competent always ensure our clients are our top priority and that they are treated with professionalism and courtesy.<br />
                            We are accredited by an International Organisation and are inspected regularly.
                        </p>
                        <p class="disc">
                              <Strong>Our Story</Strong>
  Every business has a beginning, and this is where you talk about yours. People want to know what opportunity you saw or how your passion led to the creation of something new.
                            <br /><br />
                           <Strong>Commitments</Strong>
We are committed to work impartially, maintain the confidentiality, independence and leadership in Management System Certification, Lead Auditor Training and Third Party Inspection Services.
                            <br /><br />
<Strong>Mission</Strong>
We are a leading Certification Body in the field of Management System Certification, Third Party Inspection and Lead Auditor Training Services. By creating credibility among customers & stakeholders.
                            <br /><br />
<Strong>Management System Certification Accreditation</Strong>
We are an ISO Certification Company providing management System Certification (For ISO 9001, 14001, 45001, 22000, 27001 Certification). We are a service organization, built on the ‘Best in Class’ philosophy which has helped us to achieve an enviable reputation for service excellence within the ISO Certification Body community. We provide a common sense and practical approach to management system certification. Our Certification process is user friendly. Through the certification process, we ensure that the value-added assessment to the client, to see the result at each stage so that the client can generate improvements in the existing management system on an ongoing basis.
                            <br /><br />
<Strong>Lead Auditor Training/ Internal Auditor Training Certification</Strong>
We are an Exemplar Global (RABQSA) certified training provider for Lead Auditor Training/ Internal Auditor Training (For ISO 9001, 14001, 45001, 22000 & 27001 Management System Standard). We have achieved international and industry recognition for world-class training design and delivery and has demonstrated the ability to remain at the forefront of excellence in Lead Auditor Training. The Lead Auditor Training/ Internal Auditor Training course delivered, has been designed based on the Exemplar Global (RABQSA) competency unit. For more information kindly visit www.exemplarglobal.org
                            <br /><br />
<Strong>Third-Party Inspection</Strong>
We provide the widest range of Third-party inspection services covering a wide range of industrial product/ sectors – Inspection of Welding & Fabricated Metal Products, Inspection of Machinery & Equipment (Including Inspection of Cranes, Lifting Equipment’s, and Forklift). Inspection of Pipes, Pipe Joints and Gas Pipe Lines / Oil Pipe Line Installation and Commissioning ), Inspection of Wholesale & Retail Trade, Inspection of Transport & Storage, Engineering Services, Plastic & Rubber Products, Electrical products – PCB, PLC, Wire /cable, wiring Harness, Switches / Switchgear / Control Panel, MCB, Fuses, Solar Power Projects – PV, Battery, Inverter, Fabricated Parts, Optical Equipment, Textile & Textile products – Fabrics, Made-up & Garments, Leather and Leather Products – Shoes, Jackets, Accessories, Handicraft Items – Made of Brass, Copper, Gun Metal, Wood, Paper and other Fabricated Handicraft Items, Roads – Quality Audit/ Inspection, Soil Testing/ Inspection, Food Product Inspection, Inspection of Food establishment as per GMP/GHP practices & Inspection Telecom/ Power supply – Tower Fabrication / Erection, Installation, and Commissioning.
                            <br /><br />
For any organization interested in looking for third party inspection services, then we are being an upcoming leader providing the same, can be contacted for the best professional services which include– Inspection of raw material, in-process inspection, witnessing of testing, final inspection, and testing of product, vendor audit and design review.
